   "text": "routes/index.tsx   ?home=<id>\nstart-home.tsx     create home + members\nhome-bills.tsx     bills, shares, Pay,\n                   loading/empty/error\napi.ts             fetch + 10s timeout,\n                   {error} -> message\n\nPay keeps one Idempotency-Key per share\nand reuses it on Retry",
   "originalText": "routes/index.tsx   ?home=<id>\nstart-home.tsx     create home + members\nhome-bills.tsx     bills, shares, Pay,\n                   loading/empty/error\napi.ts             fetch + 10s timeout,\n                   {error} -> message\n\nPay keeps one Idempotency-Key per share\nand reuses it on Retry",
